  "bodyHtml": "<h2>Human Genetics Amplifier (HuGeAMP) BioIndex</h2><p>Results that are displayed on the Knowledge Portals, including bottom-line genetic associations, credible sets, epigenomic annotations, global enrichments, and more, are stored in the <a href=\"https://bioindex.hugeamp.org/\" target=\"_blank\">HuGeAMP BioIndex</a> and may be queried via REST API. The results in the BioIndex are updated with each production release.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
